{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的扫读负担明显大于Y，尤其S01、S05这样的短段，话与感受交替出现，容易让观众来不及抓完信息。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然更密，但放大加亮的关键词能迅速标出心理转折，而且保留了更多具体动机，例如怕要得太多、想让对方安心、越喜欢越觉得时间过得快，让观众更容易理解人物为什么反复靠近又退缩。反复出现的水波、小船、摇荡与停定，也把开头的试探、过程中的漂浮和结尾的接受串成了一条完整的情绪线；定时出现的感受词则提供了Y较少呈现的音乐细节。Y确实更容易扫读，但部分压缩也削弱了心理动机和音乐情绪的层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8a7cf3ec-e32d-4949-b19b-e6fe58b6ece9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T232551039369Z", "elapsed_seconds": 128.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:27:59.603693+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3d488360ea23e44e9d5998624a5260d742ca563396e6ee4223bf16da4d0ae4f3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we